# Historical artifacts that default `rg` searches skip (see AGENTS.md "Context
# budget"). They stay in git and are still read or searched when their path is
# passed explicitly, e.g. `rg -n foo docs/reviews/<work-item>/`.

# Immutable review and delivery history.
docs/reviews/
docs/delivery-evidence/

# Completed operation plans and dated evidence; live contracts stay searchable.
docs/operations/*-plan.md
docs/operations/*-evidence-*.md
docs/operations/legacy-platform-retirement-*.md

# Retired v1-v3.1 workflow state and templates.
docs/archive/

# Designs of completed process work items.
docs/technical-designs/ci-workflow-contract-validation.md
docs/technical-designs/infra-legacy-platform-retirement.md
docs/technical-designs/maintenance-orchestration-*.md
docs/technical-designs/orchestration-auto-advance.md
docs/technical-designs/orchestration-usage-optimization.md
